Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n2,"Assess the change request") -> action(n3,"Check affected systems for business impact") -> action(n4,"Determine if change request should be approved") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n8,"Evaluate if change acceptable with more information") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> converge(cv1) -> action(n26,"If the change request is ultimately approved") -> action(n6,"Implement approved change") -> action(n7,"End process after implementation") -> end(e1)